terhorn mirrors in Stellisee on still mornings.","season":[6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":8,"of":23,"urls":["https://fullsuitcase.com/5-lakes-hike-zermatt/","https://theplanetd.com/5-lakes-hike-zermatt/","https://www.earthtrekkers.com/five-lakes-trail-5-seenweg-hike-is-it-worth-it/","https://www.novo-monde.com/en/5-lakes-hike-zermatt-matterhorn-viewpoint/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Gornergrat cog railway and Riffelberg ridge walk","type":"activity","detail":"Europe's highest open-air cogwheel train climbs past 3,000 m to a ridge facing 29 four-thousanders; walk down towards Riffelberg.","link":"https://www.swissrailways.com/en/buy-gornergrat-ticket","evidence":{"n_sources":8,"of":23,"urls":["https://www.gornergrat.ch/en/stories/peak2peak-ticket-summer","https://www.swissrailways.com/en/buy-gornergrat-ticket","https://www.myswissalps.com/activity/gornergrat/","https://www.earthtrekkers.com/best-hikes-in-zermatt/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Zermatt Folklore Festival","type":"festival","detail":"Second weekend of August: about 30 costumed groups from across Switzerland, alphorns and a big Sunday parade through the village.","season":[8],"link":"https://zermatt.swiss/en/discover-experience/events/top-events/folklore-festival","evidence":{"n_sources":7,"of":23,"urls":["https://zermatt.swiss/en/discover-experience/events/top-events/folklore-festival","https://www.valais.ch/en/events/folklore-festival","https://www.myswitzerland.com/en-us/experiences/events/folklore-festival/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Matterhorn Glacier Paradise cable car","type":"activity","detail":"Cable cars rise to 3,883 m, Europe's highest lift station, with a carved Glacier Palace inside the ice and year-round snow.","link":"https://www.matterhornparadise.ch/en/book/tickets/peak2peak","evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":23,"urls":["https://www.matterhornparadise.ch/en/book/tickets/peak2peak","https://www.swissrailways.com/en/buy-matterhorn-glacier